(7666129, 1250421, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t find a clear focal point. Is that intentional? If so, I''m afraid I''m not getting the meaning of it.</td>', 'I can''t find a clear focal point. Is that intentional? If so, I''m afraid I''m not getting the meaning of it.', '2020-06-12 11:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
