(7666351, 1250660, 181505, '<td valign="top">I just want to drive down this road!! It pulls me right in.</td>', 'I just want to drive down this road!! It pulls me right in.', '2020-06-15 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666352, 1250581, 181505, '<td valign="top">Lovely image!</td>', 'Lovely image!', '2020-06-15 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666389, 1250698, 24511, '<td valign="top">The red sweater and walk about good choice and positioning.  Would have preferred stronger variation of light and dark with a more in focus overall caption.  I love nature walks.  Good luck</td>', 'The red sweater and walk about good choice and positioning.  Would have preferred stronger variation of light and dark with a more in focus overall caption.  I love nature walks.  Good luck', '2020-06-15 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666391, 1250295, 24511, '<td valign="top">I get the ski hill path idea and the sky is beautiful but the competition in this challenge is too strong.  I would like to be there and feel the vastness in person.</td>', 'I get the ski hill path idea and the sky is beautiful but the competition in this challenge is too strong.  I would like to be there and feel the vastness in person.', '2020-06-16 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666392, 1250702, 24511, '<td valign="top">Lot of drama almost seemed like pollution then work of art painting done with a brush.  Purple road could be a waterfall.  Was this a forest fire?  Had voted 5 but changing to 7 for making a hidden DaVince making me wonder why I hated it so quickly at first glance.</td>', 'Lot of drama almost seemed like pollution then work of art painting done with a brush.  Purple road could be a waterfall.  Was this a forest fire?  Had voted 5 but changing to 7 for making a hidden DaVince making me wonder why I hated it so quickly at first glance.', '2020-06-16 00:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666393, 1250134, 24511, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clear scene.  Would have wanted more dirt wall and less green.  Love it but other photos in challenge have focal points or stories where yours is very very nice.  The path is less interesting than the far left wall of overtaken by the amount of green surface  was 5 now 6 because I want to go there for a walk, now.</td>', 'Wonderful clear scene.  Would have wanted more dirt wall and less green.  Love it but other photos in challenge have focal points or stories where yours is very very nice.  The path is less interesting than the far left wall of overtaken by the amount of green surface  was 5 now 6 because I want to go there for a walk, now.', '2020-06-16 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666394, 1250683, 24511, '<td valign="top">Wow, I had this at low 5 now 7 enjoyed the green specks of green on the tree trunk surface and the smooth path.  No bumping up to 8.  Done</td>', 'Wow, I had this at low 5 now 7 enjoyed the green specks of green on the tree trunk surface and the smooth path.  No bumping up to 8.  Done', '2020-06-16 00:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666395, 1250165, 24511, '<td valign="top">Only low score because sky and silhouettes too two dimensional and small for my taste.  Up score from 5 to 6 for noticing arms raised out in cheer from third to last rider</td>', 'Only low score because sky and silhouettes too two dimensional and small for my taste.  Up score from 5 to 6 for noticing arms raised out in cheer from third to last rider', '2020-06-16 00:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666396, 1250643, 24511, '<td valign="top">Unique.  Found main subject too central.  Would have liked horse slightly away from center.  Also horse overwhelming path as main theme</td>', 'Unique.  Found main subject too central.  Would have liked horse slightly away from center.  Also horse overwhelming path as main theme', '2020-06-16 00:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666397, 1250708, 24511, '<td valign="top">Train track path original entry.  Very dark up extra point now love it more second time looking</td>', 'Train track path original entry.  Very dark up extra point now love it more second time looking', '2020-06-16 00:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666398, 1250154, 24511, '<td valign="top">Love the touch of color at the back.  Too dark for me bumping up 2 more points after seeing artistic design very much appreciated.  Love the added horizontal vertical pipe like lines.  I would paint this with my watercolor and enjoy the challenge.  OK up from 5 to 8 score.  Nice job</td>', 'Love the touch of color at the back.  Too dark for me bumping up 2 more points after seeing artistic design very much appreciated.  Love the added horizontal vertical pipe like lines.  I would paint this with my watercolor and enjoy the challenge.  OK up from 5 to 8 score.  Nice job', '2020-06-16 00:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666399, 1250689, 24511, '<td valign="top">Lowest score due to grainy texture and brightness.  Sorry but other paths in this challenge seem more alluring if I compare must walk their way.</td>', 'Lowest score due to grainy texture and brightness.  Sorry but other paths in this challenge seem more alluring if I compare must walk their way.', '2020-06-16 00:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666400, 1250409, 24511, '<td valign="top">Love the bird, the path not so much.</td>', 'Love the bird, the path not so much.', '2020-06-16 00:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666402, 1250640, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the pet portrait, but this challenge is about paths, and here the path is incidental.</td>', 'I really like the pet portrait, but this challenge is about paths, and here the path is incidental.', '2020-06-16 00:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666408, 1250640, 114285, '<td valign="top">That right ear, how adorable! Youre probably getting dinged because it seems like the dog is the star of the show. And well it is. But this is totally cute!</td>', 'That right ear, how adorable! Youre probably getting dinged because it seems like the dog is the star of the show. And well it is. But this is totally cute!', '2020-06-16 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666412, 1250115, 24511, '<td valign="top">I love the three main divisions of light blue sky, darker blue water and land.  Cropping good, clear picture, paths subtle not prominent but inviting.  Higher vote if added points of interest such as action from animal/Human presence, structure of dark/ light/color vibrant tone variations from clouds or retain.  To me it was a very nice landscape.  Expert artist photographers in DPChallenge give us a big challenge.  My highest score gas yet to bring me near to the top 10 in votes.  Low score comparatively for a beautiful day memory photo.  Good luck to you and everyone here to learn.  After 100 tries David Bowie said you get one keeper.  Enjoy the journey</td>', 'I love the three main divisions of light blue sky, darker blue water and land.  Cropping good, clear picture, paths subtle not prominent but inviting.  Higher vote if added points of interest such as action from animal/Human presence, structure of dark/ light/color vibrant tone variations from clouds or retain.  To me it was a very nice landscape.  Expert artist photographers in DPChallenge give us a big challenge.  My highest score gas yet to bring me near to the top 10 in votes.  Low score comparatively for a beautiful day memory photo.  Good luck to you and everyone here to learn.  After 100 tries David Bowie said you get one keeper.  Enjoy the journey', '2020-06-16 06:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666413, 1250394, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar, but where is the fog ;)</td>', 'Looks familiar, but where is the fog ;)', '2020-06-16 06:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666414, 1250636, 24511, '<td valign="top">Lovely bright colors my favorite part of caption.  Did not like the fuzziness of the central character.  Would have liked a clear crisp final product.  Huge graffiti at the right a nice touch.  Now that I spent more time enjoying this one up another point second time better than first glance.  Absolutely love that right wall.  Path is interesting too</td>', 'Lovely bright colors my favorite part of caption.  Did not like the fuzziness of the central character.  Would have liked a clear crisp final product.  Huge graffiti at the right a nice touch.  Now that I spent more time enjoying this one up another point second time better than first glance.  Absolutely love that right wall.  Path is interesting too', '2020-06-16 06:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666415, 1250684, 24511, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Beach access.  Found bicycle too small and distracting.  Would have maybe preferred main subject to be off center slightly for increase focal point effect.</td>', 'Beautiful Beach access.  Found bicycle too small and distracting.  Would have maybe preferred main subject to be off center slightly for increase focal point effect.', '2020-06-16 06:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666416, 1250220, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very strong forest theme.  Bike trail lost in this forest could have taken more space on the whole canvas if this print.  Nice nature spot and action adds interest.  Up another point because I love nature</td>', 'Very strong forest theme.  Bike trail lost in this forest could have taken more space on the whole canvas if this print.  Nice nature spot and action adds interest.  Up another point because I love nature', '2020-06-16 06:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666417, 1250724, 24511, '<td valign="top">Seems archival historic and now that I see the title second round after close inspection additional 2 points because I love the scene an Tramway publicity.  Barren scene that elicits a hidden story.  Emotion points of appreciation added. Thanks</td>', 'Seems archival historic and now that I see the title second round after close inspection additional 2 points because I love the scene an Tramway publicity.  Barren scene that elicits a hidden story.  Emotion points of appreciation added. Thanks', '2020-06-16 06:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666418, 1250650, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and editing. In my top 3!</td>', 'Lovely light and editing. In my top 3!', '2020-06-16 06:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666419, 1250522, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved the animals would have preferred a closer look.  Tree trunk unfortunate put down but it is a working farm afterall.  Nice landscape shot.  More light and shadow or color may have raised my scoring</td>', 'Loved the animals would have preferred a closer look.  Tree trunk unfortunate put down but it is a working farm afterall.  Nice landscape shot.  More light and shadow or color may have raised my scoring', '2020-06-16 06:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666420, 1250632, 24511, '<td valign="top">This angle made me think bridge instead of path otherwise I would have voted extra 2 points.  Loved the moss clinging to structure and nearby tree''s</td>', 'This angle made me think bridge instead of path otherwise I would have voted extra 2 points.  Loved the moss clinging to structure and nearby tree''s', '2020-06-16 06:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666421, 1250545, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image. I like the muted colours and the hazy atmosphere. That person in the foreground really adds depth.</td>', 'Great image. I like the muted colours and the hazy atmosphere. That person in the foreground really adds depth.', '2020-06-16 06:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
