(7666608, 1250394, 135744, '<td valign="top">Super capture of this unusual road. Your photo may even have been taken on the same day as mine as I know we were both at the Giant''s Causeway at the same time unknowingly at the time. I took so many photos of this road and struggled to capture it on camera how amazing it looked to the eye. It doesn''t help having loads of people standing in the middle of the road most of the day. I came back quite early in the morning to take some photos with no people. Looks like you were either lucky or did the same.<br/> <br/>Anyway congrats on the HM! I am not sure I was aware it was called "The King''s Road" so that was good to find out.</td>', 'Super capture of this unusual road. Your photo may even have been taken on the same day as mine as I know we were both at the Giant''s Causeway at the same time unknowingly at the time. I took so many photos of this road and struggled to capture it on camera how amazing it looked to the eye. It doesn''t help having loads of people standing in the middle of the road most of the day. I came back quite early in the morning to take some photos with no people. Looks like you were either lucky or did the same. Anyway congrats on the HM! I am not sure I was aware it was called "The King''s Road" so that was good to find out.', '2020-06-17 08:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
